---
// src/pages/terms.astro — Terms of Use
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
const updated = '2026-07-20';
---

<Layout title="Terms of Use — Streamer">
  <div class="container legal-page">
    <div class="legal-header">
      <h1 class="legal-title">Terms of Use</h1>
      <p class="legal-updated">Last updated: {updated}</p>
    </div>

    <div class="legal-body">
      <section class="legal-section">
        <h2>1. Service description</h2>
        <p>
          Streamer ("we", "us", "the service") is a movie and TV series <strong>discovery and tracking platform</strong>.
          We provide metadata, cast/crew information, and official trailers sourced from The Movie Database (TMDB),
          and we show you where titles can be legally streamed, rented, or purchased.
        </p>
        <p>
          <strong>Streamer does not host, stream, proxy, or distribute any video content.</strong>
          All "Watch Now" links direct you to licensed third-party streaming services.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="legal-section">
        <h2>2. Permitted use</h2>
        <p>You may use Streamer to:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Browse movie and TV series metadata</li>
          <li>Search for titles, cast, and crew</li>
          <li>Save titles to your personal watchlist</li>
          <li>Rate titles you have watched</li>
          <li>Find which legal streaming services carry a title</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section class="legal-section">
        <h2>3. Prohibited use</h2>
        <p>You must not use this service to:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Circumvent, exploit, or overload the TMDB API through this service</li>
          <li>Scrape, republish, or resell data obtained through the service</li>
          <li>Attempt to access other users' accounts or data</li>
          <li>Use the service in any way that violates applicable law</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section class="legal-section">
        <h2>4. Accounts</h2>
        <p>
          You sign in using Google OAuth 2.0. You are responsible for keeping your Google account secure.
          We may suspend or terminate accounts that violate these terms.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="legal-section">
        <h2>5. TMDB data</h2>
        <p>
          Movie and TV data is provided by
          <a href="https://www.themoviedb.org/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">The Movie Database (TMDB)</a>.
          This product uses the TMDB API but is not endorsed or certified by TMDB.
          TMDB's <a href="https://www.themoviedb.org/terms-of-use" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Terms of Use</a>
          govern your use of their data.
        </p>
        <a href="https://www.themoviedb.org/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="tmdb-badge-link" aria-label="Powered by TMDB">
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 190.24 81.52" width="90" height="39" aria-hidden="true">
            <defs><linearGradient id="t-tmdb" x1="0" y1="0" x2="1" y2="0"><stop offset="0%" stop-color="#90cea1"/><stop offset="100%" stop-color="#01b4e4"/></linearGradient></defs>
            <rect width="190.24" height="81.52" rx="10" fill="url(#t-tmdb)"/>
            <text x="50%" y="52%" dominant-baseline="middle" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Arial Black,sans-serif" font-weight="900" font-size="26" fill="#0d253f" letter-spacing="2">TMDB</text>
          </svg>
        </a>
      </section>

      <section class="legal-section">
        <h2>6. Disclaimers</h2>
        <p>
          The service is provided "as is" without warranty of any kind. Streaming availability information
          is sourced from JustWatch via TMDB and may not always be accurate or up to date. Always verify
          availability on the provider's own platform.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="legal-section">
        <h2>7. Changes</h2>
        <p>
          We may update these terms from time to time. Continued use of the service after changes
          constitutes acceptance of the updated terms.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="legal-section">
        <h2>8. Contact</h2>
        <p>Questions? Email <a href="mailto:hello@streamer.com">hello@streamer.com</a>.</p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>

<style>
  .legal-page { padding-top: calc(var(--nav-offset) + 2rem); padding-bottom: 5rem; max-width: 860px; }
  .legal-header { margin-bottom: 3rem; padding-bottom: 2rem; }
  .legal-title { font-size: var(--font-size-3xl); font-weight: 700; color: var(--color-text); letter-spacing: var(--letter-spacing-tight); margin: 0 0 0.5rem; }
  .legal-updated { font-size: var(--font-size-sm); color: var(--color-text-3); margin: 0; }
  .legal-body { display: flex; flex-direction: column; }
  .legal-section { padding: 2rem 0; }
  .legal-section h2 { font-size: var(--font-size-xl); font-weight: 600; color: var(--color-text); margin: 0 0 1rem; letter-spacing: var(--letter-spacing-tight); }
  .legal-section p { font-size: var(--font-size-sm); color: var(--color-text-2); line-height: var(--line-height-loose); margin: 0 0 1rem; }
  .legal-section ul { margin: 0 0 1rem; padding-left: 1.5rem; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 0.375rem; }
  .legal-section li { font-size: var(--font-size-sm); color: var(--color-text-2); line-height: var(--line-height-normal); }
  .legal-section a { color: var(--color-accent-from); text-decoration: none; }
  .legal-section a:hover { text-decoration: underline; }
  .tmdb-badge-link { display: inline-block; margin-top: 0.75rem; opacity: 0.85; }
  .tmdb-badge-link:hover { opacity: 1; }
</style>
